{"4957150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Glyphrune", "steam_appid": 4957150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVERY VICTORY HAS A COST</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957150/extras/2969db9955e05e487913f3a343134388.poster.avif?t=1788293895\" width=1024 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957150/extras/2969db9955e05e487913f3a343134388.webm?t=1788293895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957150/extras/2969db9955e05e487913f3a343134388.mp4?t=1788293895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glyphrune is a dark medieval roguelite RPG where every battle is fought with cards, and every decision can shape the rest of your run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from four heroes, build a deck around your playstyle, study what your enemies are about to do, and choose your path through an increasingly dangerous world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Damage carries over between battles. A hard victory may leave you too wounded for whatever waits on the next road.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Death ends the entire run.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHOOSE THE ROAD AHEAD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957150/extras/69d7685a11b5c3505754d149a8433ca9.poster.avif?t=1788293895\" width=1024 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957150/extras/69d7685a11b5c3505754d149a8433ca9.webm?t=1788293895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957150/extras/69d7685a11b5c3505754d149a8433ca9.mp4?t=1788293895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across an expanding 3D world map filled with branching paths and distinct regions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One road may offer a chance to recover. Another may lead to a tougher battle with a better reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Routes come with a tradeoff. You decide how much danger you can survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD A DECK THAT CAN SURVIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn new cards as you travel and shape your deck around your hero, your strategy, and the risks ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>More cards are not always better.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build combinations that work together, remove cards that slow your deck down, and refine your strategy as enemies become more dangerous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FOUR HEROES. FOUR WAYS TO FIGHT.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957150/extras/a90d6eebf5d35135b6da58cb4dc8768b.poster.avif?t=1788293895\" width=1024 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957150/extras/a90d6eebf5d35135b6da58cb4dc8768b.webm?t=1788293895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957150/extras/a90d6eebf5d35135b6da58cb4dc8768b.mp4?t=1788293895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Knight</strong>: Defend, guard, and turn enemy attacks into opportunities to counter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mage</strong>: Control the battle with energy, wards, and elemental attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ranger</strong>: Mark enemies, control the pace of combat, and set up precise ranged strikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warrior</strong>: Rely on greater health, raw strength, and direct damage to defeat enemies before they wear you down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISCOVER WHAT THE WORLD LEFT BEHIND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957150/extras/dbf5e6f1bbd46f881b46e6a72b62e774.poster.avif?t=1788293895\" width=1024 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957150/extras/dbf5e6f1bbd46f881b46e6a72b62e774.webm?t=1788293895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957150/extras/dbf5e6f1bbd46f881b46e6a72b62e774.mp4?t=1788293895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find mysterious <strong>Glyphs</strong> hidden throughout your journey and acquire <strong>Runes</strong> that provide persistent effects between runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957150/extras/3db2207fea5da44017aedf0e512a9d52.poster.avif?t=1788293895\" width=1024 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957150/extras/3db2207fea5da44017aedf0e512a9d52.webm?t=1788293895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957150/extras/3db2207fea5da44017aedf0e512a9d52.mp4?t=1788293895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit <strong>Allies </strong>and bring their abilities into battle when you need them most.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Even when a run ends, what you discover can leave you better prepared for the next one.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE THE JOURNEY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957150/extras/3664039ab3036f28949bbc0863fc16f6.poster.avif?t=1788293895\" width=1024 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957150/extras/3664039ab3036f28949bbc0863fc16f6.webm?t=1788293895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957150/extras/3664039ab3036f28949bbc0863fc16f6.mp4?t=1788293895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through forests, deserts, mountains, and ruined cities in this war-torn world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way forward. Adapt your strategy. Choose your road carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>SEE HOW FAR YOU CAN MAKE IT.</i></strong></h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVERY VICTORY HAS A COST</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957150/extras/2969db9955e05e487913f3a343134388.poster.avif?t=1788293895\" width=1024 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957150/extras/2969db9955e05e487913f3a343134388.webm?t=1788293895\" type=\"vid