ch danger you can survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD A DECK THAT CAN SURVIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn new cards as you travel and shape your deck around your hero, your strategy, and the risks ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>More cards are not always better.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build combinations that work together, remove cards that slow your deck down, and refine your strategy as enemies become more dangerous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FOUR HEROES. FOUR WAYS TO FIGHT.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957150/extras/a90d6eebf5d35135b6da58cb4dc8768b.poster.avif?t=1788293895\" width=1024 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957150/extras/a90d6eebf5d35135b6da58cb4dc8768b.webm?t=1788293895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957150/extras/a90d6eebf5d35135b6da58cb4dc8768b.mp4?t=1788293895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Knight</strong>: Defend, guard, and turn enemy attacks into opportunities to counter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mage</strong>: Control the battle with energy, wards, and elemental attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ranger</strong>: Mark enemies, control the pace of combat, and set up precise ranged strikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warrior</strong>: Rely on greater health, raw strength, and direct damage to defeat enemies before they wear you down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISCOVER WHAT THE WORLD LEFT BEHIND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb